# Xcode / build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate

# The .xcodeproj is GENERATED from project.yml by xcodegen — never commit it.
# Critically, its generated scheme embeds the resolved PANEL_URL (server IP+token),
# so committing it would leak the secret. Regenerate locally via ./generate.sh.
*.xcodeproj/

# The app's Info.plist is GENERATED the same way: xcodegen writes it from the
# `info:` block in project.yml on every generate, resolving
# CFBundleShortVersionString from the repo's VERSION file and CFBundleVersion
# from the clock. Tracking the output meant (a) every ./generate.sh dirtied the
# tree, and (b) the committed copy was a second, always-stale statement of the
# version — VERSION is the single source (see CLAUDE.md, 版本管理). project.yml
# is the source, this file is the build output. Regenerate via ./generate.sh.
AlephPaneliOS/Resources/Info.plist

# Screenshots / scratch
*.png
# ...but DO track app-icon / asset-catalog images (real source assets)
!AlephPaneliOS/**/*.png
.DS_Store

# Local launch helper holds the gateway IP+token — never commit.
# Copy launch-local.sh.example -> launch-local.sh and fill it in.
launch-local.sh
*.local.sh
